{
  "intro": {
    "chapterTitles": {
      "windows": "What do you see outside your window?",
      "screens": "What is your working setup?",
      "opinions": "How is it working on this platform?",
      "broken": "Desribe the image. Draw the scene."
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "note-windows-grid-2",
      "phase": "windows-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 12,
      "text": "Amazon Mechanical Turk is a marketplace for paid microtasks, introduced in 2005 and named after the 18th century chess automaton that appeared autonomous while a human operator was hidden inside the cabinet.",
      "visual": {
        "mode": "image",
        "hideGrid": true,
        "fadeInMs": 4000,
        "widthRatio": 0.4,
        "images": ["/mturk.png"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-grid-3",
      "phase": "windows-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "The machine seemed intelligent but intelligence and labour was concealed.",
      "visual": {
        "mode": "image",
        "hideGrid": true,
        "fadeInMs": 0,
        "widthRatio": 0.4,
        "images": ["/mturk.png"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-grid-4",
      "phase": "windows-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 11,
      "text": "On the platform, individuals complete small units of work that machines cannot yet perform. Much of this work contributes to the creation of datasets used to train machine learning systems.",
      "visual": {
        "mode": "blackout",
        "hideGrid": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-grid-5",
      "phase": "windows-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "Image tagging. Transcription. Categorization. Short descriptions. Moderation.",
      "visual": {
        "mode": "blackout",
        "hideGrid": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-grid-6",
      "phase": "windows-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "Repetitive actions compensated in cents.",
      "visual": {
        "mode": "blackout",
        "hideGrid": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-grid-7",
      "phase": "windows-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 7,
      "text": "To understand how this operates from within, I decided to create an account as a requester.",
      "visual": {
        "mode": "image",
        "hideGrid": true,
        "fadeInMs": 0.4,
        "widthRatio": 0.9,
        "images": ["/interface.png"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-grid-8",
      "phase": "windows-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 7,
      "text": "That allowed me to define instructions, set payment, and decide what would count as acceptable work.",
      "visual": {
        "mode": "image",
        "hideGrid": true,
        "fadeInMs": 0,
        "widthRatio": 0.9,
        "images": ["/interface.png"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-grid-9",
      "phase": "windows-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 15,
      "text": "I started by asking for a photograph of the view from outside the window. I offered $0.20.",
      "visual": {
        "mode": "image",
        "hideGrid": true,
        "fadeInMs": 0.4,
        "widthRatio": 0.8,
        "images": ["/task1.jpeg"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-grid-10",
      "phase": "windows-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 10,
      "text": "With this round, I collected 203 pictures. The initial goal had been 100."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-1",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 7,
      "text": "Before posting the request, I watched YouTube tutorials and read Reddit threads where workers exchange strategies."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-2",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 7,
      "text": "Most conversations were practical: how to avoid rejection, how to calculate hourly return, how to recognize unreliable requesters."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-3",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "Workers often report earning between $1 and $6 per hour."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-4",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 13,
      "text": "Because the platform does not allow direct image uploads, I structured the request through a Google Form. The form allowed participants to upload a photo, write their city of origin, and include their MTurk ID."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-5",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 7,
      "text": "After completing it, they received a code to enter back into the platform and claim the reward."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-5-pause-beat",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-7",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 10,
      "text": "More than 50% of the images did not comply with the request. Some files were broken. Others were desktop screenshots, stock photographs, or unrelated images."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-8",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "Several entries were duplicated, sometimes more than once."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-9",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 10,
      "text": "At first glance this appears as unusable material. But it also reflects how workers navigate a system where payment is low and review is uncertain."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-10",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 7,
      "text": "Submitting quickly can reduce exposure. Reusing an image reduces effort. Duplicating an entry increases the probability of payment."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-11",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 8,
      "text": "These gestures are not loud refusals. They are adjustments inside constraints. A form of micro-resistance embedded in routine practice."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-11-pause-beat",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-12",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 6,
      "text": "Among the compliant images were residential streets, parking lots, fragments of sky, and apartment buildings."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-13",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 11,
      "text": "In several photographs there were intimate details: a curtain pulled aside by a hand, a timestamp showing 4am on a monitor, the reflections of the photographer on a glass."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-14",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "I asked for a view outward. The images also revealed the interior."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-14-pause-beat",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-15",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 7,
      "text": "Each submission appeared in my dashboard as a single row with two options: approve or reject."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-16",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "Approval transferred money. Rejection withheld it."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-17",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "In both cases, the file remained accessible to me."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-18",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 6,
      "text": "The material does not disappear when payment is refused. The archive expands regardless."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-18-pause-beat",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "note-windows-focus-19",
      "phase": "windows-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 120,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-grid-1",
      "phase": "screens-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 7,
      "text": "More than one year later, I returned to the platform and asked for photographs of working setups."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-grid-2",
      "phase": "screens-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "I uploaded my own desk as a reference image."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-35",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "The first submission I received was the same image.",
      "anchorId": "screens-35"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-18-2",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "The next submission was identical.",
      "anchorId": "screens-18"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-10-2",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "Then it appeared again.",
      "anchorId": "screens-17"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-39",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "The example became the dominant response.",
      "anchorId": "screens-100"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-18-pause-beat",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "",
      "anchorId": "screens-100"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-108-2",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "I asked for 100 images and received 140.",
      "anchorId": "screens-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-17",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "Submitting the example requires no additional effort.",
      "anchorId": "screens-17"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-45",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 10,
      "text": "By default, submissions are automatically approved after a couple of days unless manually reviewed. Workers know this. They understand that scale makes detailed review unlikely.",
      "anchorId": "screens-45"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-49",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 8,
      "text": "With a few hundred entries, I can still check one by one. At a larger scale, attention shifts to metrics.",
      "anchorId": "screens-5"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-74",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 10,
      "text": "The interface reduces each submission to a binary decision.",
      "anchorId": "screens-86"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-83",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 8,
      "text": "Approve. Reject.",
      "anchorId": "screens-13"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-10",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 12,
      "text": "Yet each image carries traces that exceed the instruction: open tabs, background applications, battery level, the type of computer, and glimpses of the room in which the work is taking place.",
      "anchorId": "screens-34",
      "zoomTo": { "x": 646.56, "y": -512.53, "scale": 4 }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-108",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 7,
      "text": "A bed behind the desk. A kitchen table used as a workstation. Night visible through a window.",
      "anchorId": "screens-89",
      "zoomTo": { "x": 336.8, "y": -405.02, "scale": 4 }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-81",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 9,
      "text": "These elements are incidental, but they reveal conditions of labor and identity. When datasets are cleaned, these traces are removed. Here they remain visible.",
      "anchorId": "screens-36",
      "zoomTo": { "x": 348.09, "y": -34.71, "scale": 5 }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-57",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 9,
      "text": "The image of a desk becomes more than documentation of a workspace.",
      "anchorId": "screens-7",
      "zoomTo": { "x": -302.34, "y": -550.32, "scale": 5 }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-screens-focus-screens-57",
      "phase": "screens-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 9,
      "text": "It shows how domestic space and paid micro-labor overlap.",
      "anchorId": "screens-85"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-grid-1",
      "phase": "opinions-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 9,
      "text": "After collecting windows and desks, I asked workers what they like and detest about working on the platform and why they continue."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-grid-2",
      "phase": "opinions-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 7,
      "text": "I posted the prompt twice. Once open to all workers. Once restricted to workers with Master status."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-grid-3",
      "phase": "opinions-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "The open round was completed in less than one hour."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-grid-4",
      "phase": "opinions-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 6,
      "text": "The Masters round remained active for three days and closed with 17 responses."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-grid-5",
      "phase": "opinions-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "Master status is assigned and maintained through continuous performance monitoring."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-16",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 37,
      "anchorId": "opinions-16",
      "text": "One worker describes MTurk as both survival and strain."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-9",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 22,
      "anchorId": "opinions-9",
      "text": "Another answer is direct: there is no protection when requesters reject."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-2",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 55,
      "text": "Several described unexplained rejections, technical malfunctions, and unpaid time. Some expressed anxiety about maintaining approval rates above strict thresholds required to access better-paying assignments.",
      "anchorId": "opinions-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-2-pause-beat",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "",
      "anchorId": "opinions-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-11",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 75,
      "text": "Access to work depends on percentages. Percentages depend on judgments that are rarely explained.",
      "anchorId": "opinions-11"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-10",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 32,
      "text": "Long-term workers keep balancing convenience and extra income against bots, broken tasks, and lost time.",
      "anchorId": "opinions-10"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-29",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 26,
      "text": "What appears as flexibility often reads, in these testimonies, as dependency and risk management.",
      "anchorId": "opinions-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-29-pause-beat",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "",
      "anchorId": "opinions-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-79",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 22,
      "anchorId": "opinions-79",
      "text": "This positive register is visible in many answers: flexibility, side income, autonomy."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-47",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 9,
      "anchorId": "opinions-47",
      "text": "A recurring line stays positive and careful, likely written to avoid risk."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-40",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 16,
      "anchorId": "opinions-40",
      "text": "Even praise is often framed in safe, generic language."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-121",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 24,
      "text": "The interface still shapes tone: workers phrase criticism carefully, and cushion it with polite language.",
      "anchorId": "opinions-121"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-opinions-121-pause-beat",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "",
      "anchorId": "opinions-121"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-opinions-focus-13",
      "phase": "opinions-focus",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 30,
      "text": "",
      "anchorId": "opinions-121"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-grid-1",
      "phase": "broken-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 7,
      "text": "Then, I selected the window photographs and uploaded them again, asking workers to describe what they saw."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-grid-2",
      "phase": "broken-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "Hundreds of descriptions arrived in less than one hour."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-grid-3",
      "phase": "broken-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 7,
      "text": "I then uploaded those descriptions and asked other workers to produce drawings based solely on the written text."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-grid-4",
      "phase": "broken-grid",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 5,
      "text": "The sequence was simple: image, text, drawing."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-focus-merged-broken-58",
      "phase": "broken-broken-seq",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 6,
      "text": "Some descriptions were detailed paragraphs.",
      "anchorId": "merged-broken-58"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-focus-merged-broken-94",
      "phase": "broken-broken-seq",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 6,
      "text": "Others were short.",
      "anchorId": "merged-broken-4"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-focus-merged-broken-3",
      "phase": "broken-broken-seq",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 10,
      "text": "Some consisted only of tags.",
      "anchorId": "merged-broken-110"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-focus-merged-broken-154",
      "phase": "broken-broken-seq",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 6,
      "text": "Houses and trees. NICE PHOTO. GARDEN. BUS.",
      "anchorId": "merged-broken-154"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-focus-merged-broken-179",
      "phase": "broken-broken-seq",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 15,
      "text": "When asked to draw, several workers did not draw. They wrote the description again.",
      "anchorId": "merged-broken-179"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-focus-merged-broken-3-2",
      "phase": "broken-broken-seq",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 6,
      "text": " Others reduced the scene to recognizable objects. Cars. Bus. People. Tree.",
      "anchorId": "merged-broken-44"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-focus-merged-broken-7",
      "phase": "broken-broken-seq",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 6,
      "text": "This does not necessarily indicate misunderstanding. It reflects how work on the platform is structured.",
      "anchorId": "merged-broken-5"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-focus-merged-broken-14",
      "phase": "broken-broken-seq",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 8,
      "text": "Workers are repeatedly asked to identify and confirm objects. Drawing is not a common or rewarded task. Labeling is.",
      "anchorId": "merged-broken-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-focus-merged-broken-17",
      "phase": "broken-broken-seq",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 8,
      "text": "Instead of adapting to an unfamiliar instruction, some translated it into a format that is legible within the system.",
      "anchorId": "merged-broken-17"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-broken-focus-merged-broken-90",
      "phase": "broken-broken-seq",
      "mode": "time",
      "active": true,
      "durationSec": 13,
      "text": "With each step, context narrowed. The atmosphere faded. Spatial relations disappeared. The scene became extractable elements.",
      "anchorId": "merged-broken-24"
    },
    {
